  "description": "<p data-start=\"263\" data-end=\"544\">Deze <strong data-start=\"268\" data-end=\"307\">Buddha to Buddha Chain Texture Ring</strong> in <strong data-start=\"311\" data-end=\"322\">maat 17</strong> is een prachtig, robuust en herkenbaar sieraad met de iconische schakelstructuur waar BTB om bekend staat. Gemaakt van hoogwaardig zilver en afgewerkt met oog voor detail, straalt deze ring zowel kracht als elegantie uit.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"546\" data-end=\"678\">Dit exemplaar verkeert <strong data-start=\"569\" data-end=\"587\">In Nette Staat</strong>: lichte draagsporen mogelijk, maar volledig gecontroleerd, authentiek en 100% functioneel.</p>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"680\" data-end=\"697\">⭐ Voordelen</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"698\" data-end=\"920\">\r\n<li data-start=\"698\" data-end=\"741\">\r\n<p data-start=\"700\" data-end=\"741\">💍 Originele Buddha to Buddha kwaliteit</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"742\" data-end=\"795\">\r\n<p data-start=\"744\" data-end=\"795\">🔗 Kenmerkende <strong data-start=\"759\" data-end=\"776\">Chain Texture</strong> schakelstructuur</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"796\" data-end=\"833\">\r\n<p data-start=\"798\" data-end=\"833\">🛠️ Handgemaakt & duurzaam zilver</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"834\" data-end=\"862\">\r\n<p data-start=\"836\" data-end=\"862\">✨ Tijdloos unisex design</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"863\" data-end=\"920\">\r\n<p data-start=\"865\" data-end=\"920\">✔️ In Nette Staat: netjes gedragen, technisch perfect</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"922\" data-end=\"925\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"927\" data-end=\"949\">📋 Specificaties</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"950\" data-end=\"1260\">\r\n<li data-start=\"950\" data-end=\"980\">\r\n<p data-start=\"952\" data-end=\"980\"><strong data-start=\"952\" data-end=\"961\">Merk:</strong> Buddha to Buddha</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"981\" data-end=\"1009\">\r\n<p data-start=\"983\" data-end=\"1009\"><strong data-start=\"983\" data-end=\"993\">Model:</strong> Chain Texture</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1010\" data-end=\"1028\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1012\" data-end=\"1028\"><strong data-start=\"1012\" data-end=\"1021\">Type:</strong> Ring</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1029\" data-end=\"1058\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1031\" data-end=\"1058\"><strong data-start=\"1031\" data-end=\"1041\">Staat:</strong> In Nette Staat</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1059\" data-end=\"1075\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1061\" data-end=\"1075\"><strong data-start=\"1061\" data-end=\"1070\">Maat:</strong> 17</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1076\" data-end=\"1101\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1078\" data-end=\"1101\"><strong data-start=\"1078\" data-end=\"1092\">Materiaal:</strong> Zilver</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1102\" data-end=\"1142\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1104\" data-end=\"1142\"><strong data-start=\"1104\" data-end=\"1114\">Stijl:</strong> Unisex – klassiek & stoer</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1143\" data-end=\"1260\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1145\" data-end=\"1260\"><strong data-start=\"1145\" data-end=\"1161\">Meegeleverd:</strong><br data-start=\"1161\" data-end=\"1164\">✔ Buddha to Buddha ring (Chain Texture)<br data-start=\"1205\" data-end=\"1208\"><em data-start=\"1210\" data-end=\"1260\">(Doosje/zakje wordt toegevoegd indien aanwezig.)</em></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1262\" data-end=\"1265\">\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1267\" data-end=\"1300\"><strong data-start=\"1271\" data-end=\"1290\">Incl. Garantie:</strong> 1 maand</h3>",
